d Group of Ministers. The urban development department aims to offer relief to property owners and improve living standards for all citizens, with practical feedback from stakeholders playing a key role in finalizing these progressive bye-laws.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/proposed-building-norm-reforms-to-benefit-property-owners-simplify-approvals-bihar-government/134402574?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-340428/134402574.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}